{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111661","id":2915488326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6txtJG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111661","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111661.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111661.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111661","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111661/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111661/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111661/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7390c358f51edaf82f0836989fd25e429f22d970","number":111661,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Consolidate typed container logic with `type_info.h`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address #111218\r\n- Supersedes #100953\r\n- Supersedes #96741\r\n- Supersedes #88567\r\n\r\nThe recent merge of #111561 enabled me to revisit this idea of simplifying typed container include logic, as that turned out to be the missing link in making everything else work! Instead of having to jump through hoops of dependency chains, `type_info.h` already has all the information it needs to declare relevant typing metadata for `TypedArray` and `TypedDictionary`.\r\n\r\nThe primary difference in this implementation compared to before is how the implementation is all handled in `type_info.h` now, instead of `variant.h`. This makes more sense logistically, as the typing metadata already exists in that context & could be safely reused. Because the information can be safely parsed ahead of time, the need for dedicated macros is completely gone: all typed containers can rely on a **single implementation** that covers all use-cases!\r\n\r\nThis entirely purges any attempted \"bonus\" codestyle changes/fixes from the original PR attempt: this attempts as atomic of a conversion as possible. As such, instead of removing the typed container headers entirely, they're now simple stub files. Miraculously, there was exactly one file where an additional include was required; everything else happens to utilize `type_info.h` transitively, which is a silver-lining of our current `#include` issues. A future PR focused entirely on stylistic changes can remove those headers outright & any references to them.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/r